@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@customerToken = {{$placeholder}}
@operatorToken = {{$placeholder}}

### Health (anonymous)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/live

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready

### Submit transfer (customer — requires Idempotency-Key and seeded demo account)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/transfers
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: http-demo-001
X-Correlation-ID: 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

{
  "sourceAccountId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
  "destinationAccountId": "22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222",
  "amount": 10.00,
  "currency": "GBP",
  "transferType": "DomesticInterbank"
}

### Get transfer by ID (owner)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/transfers/{{transferId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### Manual reject (operator only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/transfers/{{transferId}}/manual/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{operatorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: manual-reject-http-001

{
  "reason": "Demo manual rejection"
}

### Manual confirm settlement (operator only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/transfers/{{transferId}}/manual/confirm-settlement
Authorization: Bearer {{operatorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: manual-confirm-http-001

{
  "reason": "Demo manual settlement confirmation"
}

### List stuck transfers (operator only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/operations/stuck-transfers?maxResults=20
Authorization: Bearer {{operatorToken}}
X-Correlation-ID: 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002
